MODEL MajorityRuleStarter

STATUS Agree
STATUS Disagree

COMPARTMENT stance_gate
TYPE NodeCategoricalAttribute
PARAM attribute stance
PARAM value majority
PARAM probability 1

COMPARTMENT support
TYPE NodeStochastic
TRIGGER Agree
PARAM rate 0.2

COMPARTMENT pushback
TYPE NodeStochastic
TRIGGER Disagree
PARAM rate 0.2

RULE
FROM Disagree
TO Agree
USING pushback

INITIALIZE
SET Agree 0.5
SET Disagree 0.5
